  "note": "Daily and weekly challenges (the owner, Nov 17: \"Add these to the achievements page, But rename it to challenges. And we will make a plethora of daily and weekly challenges\"; their cR counts toward the rank). Every day at local midnight 4 dailies are drawn from the daily list, every Monday 1 weekly from the weekly list, the same for everyone (tools/service_record.py challenge_pick: the day or week's date decides, so a past day can always be worked out again). Changing a list changes which were drawn on past days, and so past credits. count: what one counted Reach match of the player adds: a stat of MCC's report (kills, assists, wins, games, medals, kg grenade kills, km melee kills, score, spree the most kills in a row, plus kills minus deaths, top 1 for the match's best score), medals by MCC's key or the Medals page's group, or kills with Reach damage types (weapons) or any vehicle from the kill record. cat / map: only matches of those game type families or maps; at_least: the match adds 1 when its number reaches it (a feat in one match). cr: the credits for finishing it within its day or week. icon: the site's icon for it.",
